            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Chau Giang",
            "review_text": "minh Nt\nHanoi, Vietnam156 contributions\n1\nvery nice and new facility, delicious vietnamese foods restaurant in the new administrative center of Hanoi\nDec 2019 • Friends\nChau Giang has a long history and familiar to many Hanoians. This is one of the place I entertained my foreign guests from time to time.\n\nChau Giang originally has and still serves many cantonese styled dishes and then they bring to your table many more fresh Vietnamese restaurant or family styled dishes. They have a few big tanks of live seafoods for your choicea. The food decorations are more innovative and nice looking.\n\nPrices are not very pricey.\n\nThe staffs are extremely friendly.\n\nThe restaurant just moved from Nguyen Du to this center of the new ans busy administrative zone of Hanoi in Cau Giay district. It has lot \nmore and bigger space and it has a big ballroom that can serve up to 80 guests\nRead more\nWritten December 6, 2019",
